{"seq":3,"slug":"artifact-and-registry","title":"制品与镜像仓库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/artifact-and-registry","wordCount":970,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"制品与镜像仓库\">制品与镜像仓库</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>构建制品（Artifact）</strong> 是流水线的核心产出物——容器镜像、npm 包、Helm Chart、静态资源等，其可靠管理决定部署的可追溯性与回滚能力。</p>\n<p>围绕制品有四个概念：<strong>镜像仓库（Registry）</strong> 负责 OCI 镜像的存储分发（GHCR、ECR、Harbor 等）；<strong>标签策略</strong> 结合语义化版本与 Git SHA 保证引用确定性；<strong>安全扫描</strong>（Trivy、Grype 等）在 CI 中作为阻断门禁拦截漏洞；<strong>生命周期策略</strong> 通过自动清理控制存储成本。四者共同支撑从构建到下线的完整制品管理。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建制品管理\">构建制品管理</h2><p>构建制品（Artifact）是 CI/CD 流水线的核心产出物——编译后的二进制文件、打包的容器镜像、前端静态资源等。可靠的制品管理确保部署的可追溯性和回滚能力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    SRC[源码] --&gt;|CI 构建| ARTIFACT[构建制品]&#10;    ARTIFACT --&gt;|版本标记| REG[制品仓库]&#10;    REG --&gt;|拉取| STAGING[Staging]&#10;    REG --&gt;|拉取| PROD[Production]&#10;    REG --&gt;|保留策略| CLEANUP[自动清理]\">graph LR\n    SRC[源码] --&gt;|CI 构建| ARTIFACT[构建制品]\n    ARTIFACT --&gt;|版本标记| REG[制品仓库]\n    REG --&gt;|拉取| STAGING[Staging]\n    REG --&gt;|拉取| PROD[Production]\n    REG --&gt;|保留策略| CLEANUP[自动清理]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>制品类型</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>容器镜像</td>\n<td>OCI Image</td>\n<td>Docker Hub, GHCR, ECR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>npm 包</td>\n<td>.tgz</td>\n<td>npm Registry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态资源</td>\n<td>.zip / .tar.gz</td>\n<td>S3, CDN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Helm Chart</td>\n<td>.tgz</td>\n<td>OCI Registry, ChartMuseum</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二进制文件</td>\n<td>平台特定</td>\n<td>GitHub Releases</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"容器镜像仓库\">容器镜像仓库</h2><p>容器镜像仓库是存储、管理和分发 OCI 镜像的核心基础设施。根据团队规模和安全需求选择合适的仓库服务。</p>\n<h3 id=\"github-container-registry-ghcr\">GitHub Container Registry (GHCR)</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  publish:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    permissions:&#10;      contents: read&#10;      packages: write&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: docker/login-action@v3&#10;        with:&#10;          registry: ghcr.io&#10;          username: ${{ github.actor }}&#10;          password: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;&#10;      - uses: docker/build-push-action@v6&#10;        with:&#10;          context: .&#10;          push: true&#10;          tags: ghcr.io/${{ github.repository }}:${{ github.sha }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      packages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker/login-action@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          registry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ghcr.io</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          username</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ github.actor }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          password</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker/build-push-action@v6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ghcr.io/${{ github.repository }}:${{ github.sha }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"aws-ecr\">AWS ECR</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"aws ecr get-login-password --region us-east-1 | \\&#10;  docker login --username AWS --password-stdin 123456789.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com&#10;&#10;docker tag myapp:latest 123456789.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/myapp:1.0.0&#10;docker push 123456789.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/myapp:1.0.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">aws</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ecr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get-login-password</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --region</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> us-east-1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> login</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --username</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> AWS</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --password-stdin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 123456789.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 123456789.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/myapp:1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 123456789.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/myapp:1.0.0</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>仓库服务</th>\n<th>认证方式</th>\n<th>漏洞扫描</th>\n<th>镜像签名</th>\n<th>价格模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Docker Hub</td>\n<td>用户名/密码</td>\n<td>付费</td>\n<td>DCT</td>\n<td>免费 + 付费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GHCR</td>\n<td>GITHUB_TOKEN</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>Sigstore</td>\n<td>GitHub 套餐内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS ECR</td>\n<td>IAM</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>Notation</td>\n<td>按存储量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Google Artifact</td>\n<td>gcloud auth</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>Cosign</td>\n<td>按存储量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Harbor</td>\n<td>OIDC/LDAP</td>\n<td>Trivy</td>\n<td>Cosign</td>\n<td>自建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> GHCR 对开源项目完全免费，且与 GitHub Actions 深度集成——使用 <code>GITHUB_TOKEN</code> 即可认证，无需额外配置 Secrets。对于 GitHub 上的开源项目，GHCR 是最便捷的选择。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像标签策略\">镜像标签策略</h2><p>一致的标签策略是制品可追溯性的基础。推荐结合语义化版本、Git SHA 和构建元数据多维度标记。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- uses: docker/metadata-action@v5&#10;  id: meta&#10;  with:&#10;    images: ghcr.io/${{ github.repository }}&#10;    tags: |&#10;      type=semver,pattern={{version}}&#10;      type=semver,pattern={{major}}.{{minor}}&#10;      type=semver,pattern={{major}}&#10;      type=sha,prefix=&#10;      type=ref,event=branch&#10;      type=ref,event=pr\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker/metadata-action@v5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">meta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    images</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ghcr.io/${{ github.repository }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      type=semver,pattern={{version}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      type=semver,pattern={{major}}.{{minor}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      type=semver,pattern={{major}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      type=sha,prefix=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      type=ref,event=branch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      type=ref,event=pr</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 标签生成&#10;        TAG[Git Tag: v1.2.3] --&gt; SEM1[1.2.3]&#10;        TAG --&gt; SEM2[1.2]&#10;        TAG --&gt; SEM3[1]&#10;        COMMIT[Git SHA: abc1234] --&gt; SHA[sha-abc1234]&#10;        BRANCH[Branch: main] --&gt; BR[main]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 标签生成\n        TAG[Git Tag: v1.2.3] --&gt; SEM1[1.2.3]\n        TAG --&gt; SEM2[1.2]\n        TAG --&gt; SEM3[1]\n        COMMIT[Git SHA: abc1234] --&gt; SHA[sha-abc1234]\n        BRANCH[Branch: main] --&gt; BR[main]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标签模式</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>可变性</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确版本</td>\n<td>1.2.3</td>\n<td>不可变</td>\n<td>生产部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主次版本</td>\n<td>1.2</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>自动获取补丁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git SHA</td>\n<td>sha-abc1234</td>\n<td>不可变</td>\n<td>精确追溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分支名</td>\n<td>main, develop</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>开发测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>latest</td>\n<td>latest</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>不推荐生产使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"镜像安全扫描\">镜像安全扫描</h2><p>每个发布到仓库的镜像都应经过安全漏洞扫描，将其集成到 CI 流水线中实现自动化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  scan:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: docker/build-push-action@v6&#10;        with:&#10;          context: .&#10;          load: true&#10;          tags: myapp:scan&#10;&#10;      - uses: aquasecurity/trivy-action@master&#10;        with:&#10;          image-ref: myapp:scan&#10;          format: sarif&#10;          output: trivy-results.sarif&#10;          severity: CRITICAL,HIGH&#10;&#10;      - uses: github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v3&#10;        with:&#10;          sarif_file: trivy-results.sarif\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  scan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker/build-push-action@v6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          load</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapp:scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">aquasecurity/trivy-action@master</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image-ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapp:scan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sarif</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">trivy-results.sarif</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CRITICAL,HIGH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github/codeql-action/upload-sarif@v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          sarif_file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">trivy-results.sarif</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL ghcr.io/myorg/myapp:1.2.3&#10;&#10;grype ghcr.io/myorg/myapp:1.2.3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">trivy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --severity</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> HIGH,CRITICAL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ghcr.io/myorg/myapp:1.2.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">grype</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ghcr.io/myorg/myapp:1.2.3</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扫描工具</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>集成方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Trivy</td>\n<td>快速、全面、开源</td>\n<td>GitHub Action</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grype</td>\n<td>Anchore 出品、速度快</td>\n<td>CLI / CI 集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Snyk</td>\n<td>商业、修复建议丰富</td>\n<td>GitHub App</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker Scout</td>\n<td>Docker 官方</td>\n<td>docker scout cves</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 将安全扫描设置为 CI 的<strong>阻断门禁</strong>——当发现 CRITICAL 或 HIGH 级别漏洞时，自动阻止镜像推送和部署。同时建立定期扫描机制，检测新披露的漏洞对已部署镜像的影响。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"制品生命周期\">制品生命周期</h2><p>制品的存储是有成本的，需要建立清晰的生命周期管理策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"aws ecr put-lifecycle-policy --repository-name myapp --lifecycle-policy-text &#39;{&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;rulePriority&quot;: 1,&#10;      &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Keep last 10 tagged images&quot;,&#10;      &quot;selection&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;tagStatus&quot;: &quot;tagged&quot;,&#10;        &quot;tagPrefixList&quot;: [&quot;v&quot;],&#10;        &quot;countType&quot;: &quot;imageCountMoreThan&quot;,&#10;        &quot;countNumber&quot;: 10&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;expire&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;rulePriority&quot;: 2,&#10;      &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Expire untagged after 7 days&quot;,&#10;      &quot;selection&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;tagStatus&quot;: &quot;untagged&quot;,&#10;        &quot;countType&quot;: &quot;sinceImagePushed&quot;,&#10;        &quot;countUnit&quot;: &quot;days&quot;,&#10;        &quot;countNumber&quot;: 7&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;expire&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">aws</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ecr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> put-lifecycle-policy</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --repository-name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --lifecycle-policy-text</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"rules\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"rulePriority\": 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"description\": \"Keep last 10 tagged images\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"selection\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"tagStatus\": \"tagged\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"tagPrefixList\": [\"v\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"countType\": \"imageCountMoreThan\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"countNumber\": 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"action\": { \"type\": \"expire\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"rulePriority\": 2,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"description\": \"Expire untagged after 7 days\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"selection\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"tagStatus\": \"untagged\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"countType\": \"sinceImagePushed\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"countUnit\": \"days\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"countNumber\": 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"action\": { \"type\": \"expire\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}'</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>保留策略</th>\n<th>保留数量/时间</th>\n<th>适用对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生产版本</td>\n<td>最近 20 个</td>\n<td>带 semver 标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开发版本</td>\n<td>最近 7 天</td>\n<td>分支标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未标记镜像</td>\n<td>最近 3 天</td>\n<td>dangling images</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR 构建</td>\n<td>PR 关闭后 1 天</td>\n<td>PR 标签</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 制品生命周期&#10;        BUILD[构建] --&gt; STORE[存储]&#10;        STORE --&gt; DEPLOY[部署]&#10;        DEPLOY --&gt; ARCHIVE[归档]&#10;        ARCHIVE --&gt; EXPIRE[过期清理]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 制品生命周期\n        BUILD[构建] --&gt; STORE[存储]\n        STORE --&gt; DEPLOY[部署]\n        DEPLOY --&gt; ARCHIVE[归档]\n        ARCHIVE --&gt; EXPIRE[过期清理]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((制品与镜像仓库))&#10;    制品类型&#10;      容器镜像&#10;      npm 包&#10;      Helm Chart&#10;      静态资源&#10;    镜像仓库&#10;      GHCR&#10;      ECR&#10;      Harbor&#10;    标签策略&#10;      语义化版本&#10;      Git SHA&#10;      分支名&#10;    安全扫描&#10;      Trivy&#10;      Grype&#10;      CI 阻断门禁&#10;    生命周期&#10;      保留策略&#10;      自动清理&#10;      成本控制\">mindmap\n  root((制品与镜像仓库))\n    制品类型\n      容器镜像\n      npm 包\n      Helm Chart\n      静态资源\n    镜像仓库\n      GHCR\n      ECR\n      Harbor\n    标签策略\n      语义化版本\n      Git SHA\n      分支名\n    安全扫描\n      Trivy\n      Grype\n      CI 阻断门禁\n    生命周期\n      保留策略\n      自动清理\n      成本控制</pre><ul>\n<li>构建制品包括容器镜像、npm 包、Helm Chart 和静态资源，需要统一的版本管理和存储策略。</li>\n<li>GHCR 对开源项目免费且与 GitHub Actions 深度集成，企业内部推荐 Harbor 或云平台方案。</li>\n<li>标签策略应结合<strong>语义化版本</strong>和 <strong>Git SHA</strong>，生产环境使用精确版本号。</li>\n<li>安全扫描应集成到 CI 流水线中作为阻断门禁，同时建立定期扫描机制。</li>\n<li>制品生命周期管理通过自动清理策略控制存储成本，生产版本保留更久。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"制品与镜像仓库","id":"制品与镜像仓库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"构建制品管理","id":"构建制品管理"},{"level":2,"text":"容器镜像仓库","id":"容器镜像仓库"},{"level":3,"text":"GitHub Container Registry (GHCR)","id":"github-container-registry-ghcr"},{"level":3,"text":"AWS ECR","id":"aws-ecr"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像标签策略","id":"镜像标签策略"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像安全扫描","id":"镜像安全扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"制品生命周期","id":"制品生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GitHub Actions 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions-deep-dive"},"next":{"title":"部署策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/deployment-strategies"}}